#: include/global_form.php:1301
msgid ""
"The number of concurrent threads to use for polling this device.  This "
"applies to the Spine poller only."
msgstr ""
"Antalet samtidiga trådar för insamling från enheten. Gäller endast "
"datainsamlaren Spine."

#: include/global_settings.php:2371
msgid ""
"If the boost poller exceeds this runtime, a warning will be placed in the "
"cacti log,"
msgstr ""
"Om Boost-processen överskrider denna körtid skrivs en varning till Cactis "
"logg."

#: include/global_settings.php:2378
msgid ""
"Enables direct insert of records into poller output boost table with results"
" in a 25% time reduction in each poll cycle."
msgstr ""
"Infogar poster direkt i datainsamlarens Boost-utdatatabell, vilket minskar "
"tiden för varje insamlingscykel med 25 %."
